    <item>
      <title>AI Builders Lisbon - Sep 30</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/lis-sep30?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_ai</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1124</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 14:40:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Join our informal meetup for the biggest AI nerds!
We share the latest insights about: AI dev tools, Agent frameworks, RAG, vibe coding, OpenClaw, Claude Code and more!
// FOR WHO
✅ Devs, Product peeps, Data lovers, ML engineers, Founders
✅ Anyone building with AI
⚠️ Some LLM knowledge required!
// FORMAT
🎤 Innovative AI Demos — from EU + Silicon Valley leaders
💻 Builder Tool Demos — ship fast, explain faster
🤝 🍻 A LOT of time for informal networking
🍕 Yummy Pizza &amp; Snacks
// AGENDA
18:30 �</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/ri/39dc7bb1-9e62-440c-935a-39741d9d583f.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Wednesday, 30 September 2026 at 18:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>Join our informal meetup for the biggest AI nerds!<br>We share the latest insights about: AI dev tools, Agent frameworks, RAG, vibe coding, OpenClaw, Claude Code and more!<br>// FOR WHO<br>✅ Devs, Product peeps, Data lovers, ML engineers, Founders<br>✅ Anyone building with AI<br>⚠️ Some LLM knowledge required!<br>// FORMAT<br>🎤 Innovative AI Demos — from EU + Silicon Valley leaders<br>💻 Builder Tool Demos — ship fast, explain faster<br>🤝 🍻 A LOT of time for informal networking<br>🍕 Yummy Pizza &amp; Snacks<br>// AGENDA<br>18:30 👋 Walk-in<br>19:00 🎤 Using AI to Become More Human<br>- Guilherme Fontes @ Familiar Tools<br>19:35 💻 A2UI Components, AGUI Protocol, ADK Agent Orchestration, and Gemma Nano Inference on Android Phones<br>- Jolanda Verhoef<br>19:50 💻 AI Demo<br>20:05 🍕 Pizza &amp; Drinks<br>20:20 🤝 Networking<br>20:50 🔚 End<br>// FAQ<br>What is AI Builders? A self-organizing nonprofit community of 5000+ AI nerds 🤓. We&apos;re building a democratic AI platform, to make our community completely co-owned and co-governed by you (yes, all attendees).<br>New question?<br>Will it be recorded? Yes, some sessions are streamed live and recorded. By attending, you consent to being photographed and filmed. Let us know if you don&apos;t want to be on camera.<br>I&apos;m not technical. Can I come? Yes, but to actually enjoy the meetup we recommend understanding basic LLM concepts: Agents, Embeddings, RAG, MCPs, Inference, Structured Output, Finetuning, APIs, Reinforcement Learning. Not sure what those mean? Ask any chatbot — that&apos;s literally what they&apos;re for.<br>Why do I need to pay? 1) So we know how many people will show up — less food waste and better allocation of limited seats. 2) Sponsorships don&apos;t cover all our costs (yet)! Every euro goes back into the community.<br>Can I get a free ticket? Can I volunteer? Money should never be the reason not to join. If you need a sponsored ticket, or want to help out by arriving 1.5h early to set up, message AI.<br>Can I demo, give a talk, or just help out? Message AI if you want to shine ✨ on stage and grow your network — community demos are 10 minutes, builder demos are 15-20 minutes.<br>What time does the event start? The event starts at 18:00 on Wednesday, 30 September.<br>Where is the venue located? The event will be held at IDEA Spaces - São Sebastião, Avenida António Augusto Aguiar N.122C, Lisbon, pt.<br>Is food provided? Yes! We&apos;ll have pizza and drinks available.<br>// VENUE &amp; SPONSORS<br>We look forward to hanging out with you!<br>Thanks to our friends for hosting us in their beautiful space.</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/lis-sep30?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_ai">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
