    <item>
      <title>20-20 - a Pecha-Kucha style event for AI Builders (members+, in-person, Lisbon)</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/1qe8e5rq?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_ai</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1270</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:48:46 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Twenty slides. Twenty seconds each. No pausing, no going back.
Red Bridge is launching its first Pecha-Kucha style night — 20-20 — a fast-paced format built to make AI builders do the hardest thing in tech: get to the point.
Each presenter takes the floor with 20 slides and 20 seconds per slide. The deck advances whether you&apos;re ready or not, so what&apos;s left is the essence of an idea — enough to spark a conversation, start a collaboration, or find the one person in the room already working on the </description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/d1/12e5efaa-d9f4-4f1a-bb37-41b0f7e07393.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Thursday, 10 December 2026 at 18:30<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>Twenty slides. Twenty seconds each. No pausing, no going back.<br>Red Bridge is launching its first Pecha-Kucha style night — 20-20 — a fast-paced format built to make AI builders do the hardest thing in tech: get to the point.<br>Each presenter takes the floor with 20 slides and 20 seconds per slide. The deck advances whether you&apos;re ready or not, so what&apos;s left is the essence of an idea — enough to spark a conversation, start a collaboration, or find the one person in the room already working on the thing you needed.<br>Come to present, or come to watch the ideas fly. Either way, expect sharp thinking, good company, and the kind of connections that only happen at RedBridge Lisbon.<br>Open to RedBridge Lisbon members and the wider Lisbon AI community. Hosted at AI Hub by Unicorn Factory Lisboa.<br>🗓️ Thursday, December 10th · 6:30–8:30pm<br>📍 AI Hub by Unicorn Factory Lisboa<br>Want to present? Apply here: https://tally.so/r/68YA8O</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/1qe8e5rq?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_ai">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
  </channel>
</rss>
